      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 12: from about 09:00 to 18:00 I was at the grocery; around 18:03 I passed through the square; around 18:09 I passed through Mill Road; from about 18:15 to 20:15 I was at home; around 20:08 I passed through Mill Road; around 20:14 I passed through the square; from about 20:15 to 22:15 I was at the Lantern; around 22:12 I passed through the square; around 22:18 I passed through Mill Road; from about 22:30 to 08:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 08:14 I passed through Mill Road; around 08:20 I passed through the square; from about 08:15 to 18:00 I was at the grocery; around 18:04 I passed through the square; from about 18:00 to 22:15 I was at the Lantern; around 22:13 I passed through the square; around 22:19 I passed through Mill Road; from about 22:30 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 16380,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "anton",
       "elias"
      ],
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0003",
      "place": null,
      "source": "told",
      "text": "Anton told me there's bad blood between them and Elias \u2014 something said at the pub years ago.",
      "time": null,
      "topics": [
       "conflicts",
       "person:anton",
       "person:elias",
       "rumors"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "felix",
       "tomas"
      ],
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0004",
      "place": null,
      "source": "told",
      "text": "Anton told me Felix owes Tomas 38 crowns.",
      "time": null,
      "topics": [
       "money",
       "person:felix",
       "person:tomas",
       "rumors"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "agnes",
       "ida"
      ],
      "era": "earlier",
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "in": "K0071",
      "key": "K0005",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "I turned Ida down when they asked me for a loan, around 20:45 on Day 7.",
      "time": 9889,
      "topics": [
       "money",
       "person:ida"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "ida"
      ],
      "era": "earlier",
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "in": "K0071",
      "key": "K0006",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "Ida came asking me for money, around 20:45 on Day 7. Times are hard for them.",
      "time": 9889,
      "topics": [
       "money",
       "person:ida"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [],
      "era": "earlier",
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0007",
      "place": "grocery",
      "source": "self",
      "text": "I found 18 crowns missing from the grocery till. It went missing from about 18:00 on Day 6 to 09:00 on Day 8.",
      "time": 8279,
      "topics": [
       "past"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "anton",
       "tomas"
      ],
      "era": "earlier",
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0008",
      "place": null,
      "source": "told",
      "text": "Anton told me they couldn't pay the rent to Tomas.",
      "time": 10560,
      "topics": [
       "money",
       "person:anton",
       "person:tomas",
       "rumors"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "henrik"
      ],
      "era": "earlier",
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0009",
      "place": "grocery",
      "source": "inferred",
      "text": "If you ask me, Henrik had something to do with 18 crowns missing from the grocery till.",
      "time": 8279,
      "topics": [
       "past",
       "person:henrik"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "agnes",
