      "key": "K0080",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 12: from about 09:00 to 09:00 I was at home; around 09:05 I passed through Mill Road; around 09:11 I passed through the square; from about 09:15 to 17:15 I was at the grocery; around 17:14 I passed through the square; around 17:20 I passed through Mill Road; from about 17:30 to 08:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 08:16 I passed through Mill Road; around 08:22 I passed through the square; from about 08:30 to 17:15 I was at the grocery; around 17:17 I passed through the square; around 17:23 I passed through Mill Road; from about 17:30 to 21:15 I was at home; around 21:10 I passed through Mill Road; around 21:16 I passed through the square; from about 21:15 to 22:15 I was at the Lantern; around 22:16 I passed through the square; around 22:22 I passed through Mill Road; from about 22:30 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 16380,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "anton",
       "elias"
      ],
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0081",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "Elias and I have never got on \u2014 something said at the pub years ago.",
      "time": null,
      "topics": [
       "conflicts",
       "person:elias"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "felix",
       "tomas"
      ],
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0082",
      "place": null,
      "source": "told",
      "text": "Tomas told me Felix owes them 38 crowns.",
      "time": null,
      "topics": [
       "money",
       "person:felix",
       "person:tomas",
       "rumors"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
