      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 12, from about 09:00 I was at the workshop; at the Lantern from about 17:00; home around 22:30 and to bed; on Day 13 back at the workshop from about 08:15; back at the Lantern from about 17:15; home around 21:15 and to bed.",
