      "text": "On Day 12: from about 09:00 to 16:15 I was at the mill; around 16:09 I passed through Mill Road; around 16:15 I passed through the square; from about 16:15 to 21:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 21:12 I passed through the square; from about 21:15 to 22:00 I was at the Lantern; around 22:06 I passed through the square; from about 22:15 to 07:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 07:15 I passed through the square; around 07:21 I passed through Mill Road; from about 07:30 to 16:15 I was at the mill; around 16:16 I passed through Mill Road; around 16:22 I passed through the square; from about 16:30 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 16380,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "anton",
       "elias"
      ],
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0183",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "Anton and I have never got on \u2014 something said at the pub years ago.",
      "time": null,
      "topics": [
       "conflicts",
       "person:anton"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
