      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 12, from about 09:00 I was at the grocery; at the clinic from about 09:15; home around 17:15; at the Lantern from about 18:15; home around 22:15 and to bed; on Day 13 back at the clinic from about 09:15; after that it gets hazy \u2014 I'd had a fair bit to drink; home around 17:15; back at the Lantern from about 18:00; home around 22:00 and to bed.",
      "time": 16380,
