      "in": "K0218",
      "key": "K0219",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 12: from about 09:00 to 09:00 I was at the grocery; around 09:07 I passed through the square; from about 09:15 to 17:15 I was at the clinic; around 17:14 I passed through the square; from about 17:15 to 18:00 I was at home; around 18:07 I passed through the square; from about 18:15 to 22:00 I was at the Lantern; around 22:05 I passed through the square; from about 22:15 to 09:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 09:14 I passed through the square; from about 09:15 to 17:15 I was at the clinic; after that it gets hazy \u2014 I'd had a fair bit to drink; around 17:09 I passed through the square; from about 17:15 to 18:00 I was at home; around 18:04 I passed through the square; from about 18:00 to 22:00 I was at the Lantern; around 22:03 I passed through the square; from about 22:00 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 16380,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "anton",
       "elias"
      ],
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0220",
      "place": null,
      "source": "told",
      "text": "Anton told me there's bad blood between them and Elias \u2014 something said at the pub years ago.",
      "time": null,
      "topics": [
       "conflicts",
       "person:anton",
       "person:elias",
       "rumors"
      ]
     },
     {
