      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 12, from about 09:00 I was at the mill; home around 16:30 and to bed; on Day 13 back at the mill from about 07:15; home around 16:30; at the grocery from about 17:00; at the Lantern from about 18:15; home around 22:15 and to bed.",
