      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 12, from about 09:00 I was at the mill; at the grocery from about 14:15; at the Lantern from about 15:00; home around 19:15 and to bed; on Day 13 back at the mill from about 08:15; back at the grocery from about 14:15; at the square from about 15:00; home around 19:15 and to bed.",
      "time": 16380,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
