      "guarded": false,
      "in": "K0318",
      "key": "K0319",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 12: from about 09:00 to 14:15 I was at the mill; around 14:09 I passed through Mill Road; around 14:15 I passed through the square; from about 14:15 to 15:00 I was at the grocery; around 15:04 I passed through the square; from about 15:00 to 19:15 I was at the Lantern; around 19:08 I passed through the square; around 19:14 I passed through Mill Road; from about 19:15 to 08:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 08:07 I passed through Mill Road; from about 08:15 to 14:15 I was at the mill; around 14:11 I passed through Mill Road; around 14:17 I passed through the square; from about 14:15 to 15:00 I was at the grocery; from about 15:00 to 19:15 I was at the square; around 19:10 I passed through Mill Road; from about 19:15 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 16380,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "anton",
       "elias"
      ],
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0320",
      "place": null,
      "source": "told",
      "text": "Tomas told me there's bad blood between Anton and Elias \u2014 something said at the pub years ago.",
      "time": null,
      "topics": [
       "conflicts",
       "person:anton",
       "person:elias",
       "rumors"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "felix",
       "tomas"
      ],
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": true,
      "key": "K0321",
      "place": null,
      "source": "told",
      "text": "Elias told me Felix owes Tomas 38 crowns.",
      "time": null,
      "topics": [
       "money",
       "person:felix",
       "person:tomas",
       "rumors"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "agnes",
       "ida"
      ],
      "era": "earlier",
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "in": "K0362",
      "key": "K0322",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "I asked Agnes for a loan around 20:45 on Day 7. They said no.",
      "time": 9889,
      "topics": [
       "money",
       "person:agnes"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "ida",
       "tomas"
      ],
      "era": "earlier",
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0323",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "I couldn't make the rent to Tomas.",
      "time": 10560,
      "topics": [
       "money",
       "person:tomas"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "anton",
       "tomas"
      ],
      "era": "earlier",
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0324",
      "place": null,
      "source": "told",
      "text": "Tomas told me Anton couldn't pay the rent to them.",
      "time": 10560,
      "topics": [
       "money",
       "person:anton",
       "person:tomas",
       "rumors"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "agnes",
       "ida"
      ],
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0325",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "I've been taking food on credit from Agnes; I owe 42 crowns.",
      "time": null,
      "topics": [
       "money",
       "person:agnes"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [],
      "era": "earlier",
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0326",
      "place": "grocery",
      "source": "told",
      "text": "Anton told me about 18 crowns missing from the grocery till; it went missing from about 18:00 on Day 6 to 09:00 on Day 8.",
      "time": 8279,
      "topics": [
       "past",
       "rumors"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [],
      "era": "earlier",
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0327",
      "place": "grocery",
      "source": "told",
      "text": "Vera told me about 18 crowns missing from the grocery till; it went missing from about 18:30 on Day 6 to 09:30 on Day 8.",
      "time": 8309,
      "topics": [
       "past",
       "rumors"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "agnes",
       "ida"
      ],
      "era": "earlier",
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "in": "K0362",
      "key": "K0328",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "I asked Agnes for credit at the grocery around 09:45 on Day 11. They said no.",
      "time": 14990,
      "topics": [
       "money",
       "person:agnes"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [],
      "era": "earlier",
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": true,
      "key": "K0329",
      "place": "grocery",
      "source": "told",
      "text": "Vera told me about 18 crowns missing from the grocery till; it went missing from about 19:30 on Day 6 to 10:30 on Day 8.",
      "time": 8369,
      "topics": [
       "past",
       "rumors"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "anton",
       "tomas"
      ],
      "era": "earlier",
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": true,
      "key": "K0330",
      "place": null,
      "source": "told",
      "text": "Vera told me Anton paid Tomas back 40 crowns around 18:45 on Day 8.",
      "time": 11207,
      "topics": [
       "money",
       "person:anton",
       "person:tomas",
       "rumors"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "anton"
      ],
      "era": "earlier",
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": true,
      "key": "K0331",
      "place": "grocery",
      "source": "told",
      "text": "Vera told me Anton had something to do with 18 crowns missing from the grocery till.",
      "time": 8249,
      "topics": [
       "past",
       "person:anton",
       "rumors"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "anton"
      ],
      "era": "earlier",
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0332",
      "place": "grocery",
      "source": "inferred",
      "text": "If you ask me, Anton had something to do with 18 crowns missing from the grocery till.",
      "time": 8369,
      "topics": [
