      "key": "K0371",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 12: from about 09:00 to 17:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 17:07 I passed through the square; from about 17:15 to 23:15 I was at the Lantern; around 23:08 I passed through the square; from about 23:15 to 17:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 17:19 I passed through the square; from about 17:15 to 23:00 I was at the Lantern; around 23:06 I passed through the square; from about 23:15 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
