       "K0389",
       "K0390"
      ],
      "place": null,
      "source": "told",
      "text": "I hear Ida was asking around for money a while ago, and Agnes and Tomas said no.",
      "time": 8390,
      "topics": [
       "money",
       "person:ida",
       "rumors"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
