      ],
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 12, from about 09:00 I was at the mill; home around 16:30 and to bed; on Day 13 back at the mill from about 07:15; home around 16:30; at the Lantern from about 19:00; home around 22:00 and to bed.",
      "time": 16380,
      "topics": [
