      "key": "K0470",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 12: from about 09:00 to 09:15 I was at the grocery; around 09:15 I passed through the square; around 09:21 I passed through Mill Road; from about 09:30 to 11:00 I was at home; around 11:03 I passed through Mill Road; around 11:05 I passed through the square; from about 11:00 to 23:00 I was at the Lantern; around 23:05 I passed through the square; around 23:07 I passed through Mill Road; from about 23:15 to 11:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 11:16 I passed through Mill Road; around 11:18 I passed through the square; from about 11:15 to 23:00 I was at the Lantern; around 23:04 I passed through the square; around 23:06 I passed through Mill Road; from about 23:15 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 16380,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "anton",
